     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">Hello, a new version of poppr has been released this week.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;\">This version of poppr introduces the function <code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157);border-radius:3px\">bootgen2genind()</code> that allows you to use <code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;padding-top:0.2em;padding-bottom:0.2em;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.0392157);border-radius:3px\">aboot()</code>with distance functions that explicitly expect &quot;genind&quot; objects (type </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>?aboot</b></font><font face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"> in your R console for details):</font><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px\"><font face=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol\"><br></font></p><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:13.6px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);border-radius:3px;word-break:normal\">aboot(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">myData</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">dist</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">myDist</span>) <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(150,152,150)\"># fails</span>\r\naboot(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">myData</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">dist</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">function</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">x</span>) myDist(bootgen2genind(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">x</span>))) <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(150,152,150)\"># works</span></pre></div><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">There are other various bug fixes and improvements, which are listed at <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.3.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.3.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480756651000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2x9oabrhCDpV3yZZ9g30ig\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.3.0</a> </p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">Cheers,</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;font-size:16px\">Zhian</p><div><br></div></div>"
